          {
            "title": "Multiple values",
            "id": 88373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple berguna karena memungkinkan kita mengembalikan beberapa nilai dari sebuah fungsi, seperti skor tertinggi dan terendah dari sebuah list.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi dapat mengembalikan beberapa value sebagai tuple. Pisahkan dengan koma.</p><p>Kembalikan <code>highest_score</code> terlebih dahulu, lalu <code>lowest_score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"max\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"min\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"lowest_score, highest_score\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return a tuple",
            "id": 88377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk mengembalikan tuple, kita menulis nilai-nilai yang ingin kita kembalikan dan memisahkannya dengan koma <code>,</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "No parentheses",
            "id": 88378,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Meskipun kita mengembalikan tuple, tanda kurung tidak diperlukan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat mengembalikan beberapa value, kita memisahkannya dengan koma tanpa memerlukan tanda kurung.</p><p>Kembalikan <code>highest_score</code> terlebih dahulu, lalu <code>lowest_score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores_list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>highest_score</code>, <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store return value",
            "id": 88379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyimpan tuple yang dikembalikan oleh sebuah fungsi, kita menetapkan hasil pemanggilan fungsi ke variabel seperti <code>data</code>, seperti biasa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>data</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyimpan tuple yang dikembalikan, tetapkan hasil pemanggilan fungsi ke variabel.</p><p>Simpan tuple dalam <code>data</code> agar kode mencetak <code>(80, 17)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"169\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>data</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>get_scores_data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Retrieve individual values",
            "id": 88380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita kemudian dapat mengambil setiap nilai berdasarkan indeksnya, seperti skor tertinggi dengan <code>data[0]</code>, dan skor terkecil dengan <code>data[1]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"193\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>highest</code>, diikuti oleh <code>data[1]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skor terendah berada di indeks <code>1</code> dalam tuple kembalian. Simpan dalam <code>smallest</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>smallest score: 17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"219\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>smallest</code>, diikuti oleh <code>data[1]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a tuple",
            "id": 88381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena tuple bersifat immutable, kita mengembalikan tuple saat tidak perlu mengubahnya, melainkan hanya menggunakan nilainya, seperti pada pemenang sebuah game.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena tuple bersifat immutable, kembalikan tuple saat kamu hanya perlu menggunakan value-nya, bukan mengubahnya.</p><p>Kembalikan tiga pemain pertama secara berurutan agar kode mencetak <code>First: Sue</code>, lalu Ed, lalu Ann.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players[1], players[0], players[2]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a list",
            "id": 88382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita ingin dapat memodifikasi koleksi nilai yang dikembalikan, seperti memperbarui anggota tim, kita menggunakan <code>return</code> untuk mengembalikan list seperti <code>team</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"form_team\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team = form_team(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chloe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(team)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Chloe', 'Ann']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>return team</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple values",
            "id": 88670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa salah satu kegunaan utama tuple?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mengembalikan beberapa nilai di dalam fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menampilkan nilai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mengembalikan beberapa nilai di dalam fungsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salah satu kegunaan utama tuple adalah mengembalikan beberapa nilai dari fungsi.</p><p>Sebuah fungsi menghitung <code>width</code> dan <code>height</code>. Pernyataan mana yang mengembalikan kedua hasil itu bersama-sama?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return width, height</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(width, height)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return width</code> diikuti oleh <code>return height</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return width, height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return a tuple",
            "id": 88671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita memisahkan nilai-nilai yang berbeda saat mengembalikan beberapa nilai dari sebuah fungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menggunakan koma <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menggunakan titik koma <code>;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menggunakan koma <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita memisahkan beberapa nilai kembalian dengan koma.</p><p>Baris mana yang mengembalikan <code>lowest</code> dan <code>highest</code> dengan benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return lowest, highest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest; highest</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest highest</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return lowest, highest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No parentheses",
            "id": 88672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apakah kita memerlukan tanda kurung saat mengembalikan beberapa nilai?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak, cukup kata kunci <code>return</code> diikuti oleh nilai-nilai tersebut</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ya, di sekitar setiap nilai secara individual</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak, cukup kata kunci <code>return</code> diikuti oleh nilai-nilai tersebut.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita tidak memerlukan tanda kurung saat mengembalikan beberapa nilai, cukup <code>return</code> diikuti nilai-nilainya.</p><p>Apa yang dikembalikan <code>return name, age</code> kepada pemanggil?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tuple yang berisi <code>name</code> dan <code>age</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya <code>name</code>, karena <code>age</code> berada di luar tanda kurung</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Error, karena setiap nilai memerlukan tanda kurung sendiri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tuple yang berisi <code>name</code> dan <code>age</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store return value",
            "id": 88673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara menyimpan tuple yang dikembalikan oleh sebuah fungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan menyimpannya dalam variabel, seperti nilai lainnya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa menyimpan tuple yang dikembalikan oleh fungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan menyimpannya dalam variabel, seperti nilai lainnya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menyimpan tuple yang dikembalikan fungsi dalam variabel seperti nilai lainnya.</p><p>Baris mana yang menyimpan tuple dari <code>get_bounds()</code> dalam <code>bounds</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bounds = get_bounds()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bounds == get_bounds()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_bounds(bounds)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bounds = get_bounds()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Retrieve individual values",
            "id": 88674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara mengambil nilai-nilai individual dari tuple yang dikembalikan oleh sebuah fungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Berdasarkan indeksnya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Berdasarkan nilainya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Berdasarkan indeksnya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita mengambil nilai individual dari tuple kembalian berdasarkan indeksnya.</p><p>Variabel <code>profile</code> menyimpan <code>(\"Mia\", 21)</code>. Ekspresi mana yang mengambil usia?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>profile[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>profile[21]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>profile.age</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>profile[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
